1c8dffa4ca55770adf182c4b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, my name is so and so.\nI am sending you a request to be placed on the board as a KP character for a TRPG.\nI would like a girl with a wolf motif, one white and one black, each designed as a twin. The clothes should be white Lolita or Gothic Lolita style, with dog ears and tail would be great. It would also be helpful if the facial expressions are in contrast to ☺️😐.\nI know this is a very vague request, but I would appreciate it if you could give it some thought.\nThank you in advance.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainlily_00/works/110", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2dce53c/uploads/origins/4cb3ac09-2f10-4462-abc8-a56503cd3bfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fae48ce2dcdf1e36af12f5e5ca51a48", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2dce53c/uploads/origins/4cb3ac09-2f10-4462-abc8-a56503cd3bfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fae48ce2dcdf1e36af12f5e5ca51a48, https://si.imgix.net/c2dce53c/uploads/origins/4cb3ac09-2f10-4462-abc8-a56503cd3bfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d57c197e1e45222bd63e597a0652f5c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c2dce53c/uploads/origins/4cb3ac09-2f10-4462-abc8-a56503cd3bfb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08fb2434ecd589fd6db0abdb27dd3d9c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your chibi illustrations are so cute, I would love if you drew my character, Soyuu. She's shy corrupted angel. Soyuu has blue hair , a black halo and wings and she wears a white fluffy dress with a black harness . She also has a pet Bee who you can add if you would like. For the pose could you have her flying with a leaf glider like the reference, with a mushroom hat if possible.\n\nFor use on sns/Youtube/Twitch. Thank you for considering my request~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1O5jcmrVknZmbhbaFXpgrl0k8fFkJJex3?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainlily_00/works/109", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3792494f/uploads/origins/60a8e0a0-723b-4f31-a93f-2bb962d2cb8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b03ecf5110894a22cd3c252bb29ed3e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3792494f/uploads/origins/60a8e0a0-723b-4f31-a93f-2bb962d2cb8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b03ecf5110894a22cd3c252bb29ed3e2, https://si.imgix.net/3792494f/uploads/origins/60a8e0a0-723b-4f31-a93f-2bb962d2cb8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d7863701b32d4ddad6228ee3743e600 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3792494f/uploads/origins/60a8e0a0-723b-4f31-a93f-2bb962d2cb8b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=127b8381bff0f9a19c1c45e672d95d72 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your illustrations are very beautiful! I love your chibi character illustrations! I wanted to request for you to draw my Vtuber character.\n\nShe is a mermaid princess, and she has seashell pupils in her eyes, and small pink scales on her body. She is cheerful, but not very smart. She is also a yumejoshi and she loves games, anime, and manga! Her motifs are seashells and fish.\n\nInstead of her normal outfit, she would be wearing this outfit: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1y4VhnlW7Mr49UGXQlV5pFfnCV9LPIYIb/view?usp=sharing\n\nShe would still be wearing her usual beret and glasses.\n\nIf possible, I would like a transparent png file of the drawing as well for use on social media (Twitter, Twitch, Youtube). \nThank you very much! I would be very happy if you accepted this request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tJ2WlcDiThvjsb8jFBh0BrCRxmnV3Bh0?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainlily_00/works/108", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c1927b71/uploads/origins/19338973-237f-4593-809e-6ca812a05054?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72e483e37b1c01b5335c1a269f46d420", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c1927b71/uploads/origins/19338973-237f-4593-809e-6ca812a05054?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72e483e37b1c01b5335c1a269f46d420, https://si.imgix.net/c1927b71/uploads/origins/19338973-237f-4593-809e-6ca812a05054?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dafe26a7de6b6d0cbf0273756dc2473 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c1927b71/uploads/origins/19338973-237f-4593-809e-6ca812a05054?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61ed28f24e704f84b2aec48538343122 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nMay I request 2 separate chibis of my OC in different forms?\nOne will be the human form, and one will be the cat form (see \"cat_form.png\" for idea)\n\nMy OC is a former pirate who loves to drink beer with friends.\nHe's also very mischievous and loves to play pranks on friends.\nIf possible, please draw with both eyes open.\nPlease use the pirate clothes.\nI'll leave everything else up to you.\n\nThank you for considering!\n\nhttps://app.box.com/s/gu8942f47x8m4ln2ayn6ml41e2uj0b7v", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainlily_00/works/107", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7078e6bb/uploads/origins/0548ba56-6cc4-4b06-b87f-5f1eb5e747a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a25a1814a60043914f4b9c3f2cd521ee", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7078e6bb/uploads/origins/0548ba56-6cc4-4b06-b87f-5f1eb5e747a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a25a1814a60043914f4b9c3f2cd521ee, https://si.imgix.net/7078e6bb/uploads/origins/0548ba56-6cc4-4b06-b87f-5f1eb5e747a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03d3e6f635bba2e790c1ef9e92f88744 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7078e6bb/uploads/origins/0548ba56-6cc4-4b06-b87f-5f1eb5e747a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5752c98dd7c69c535e00aef43cf7dd88 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nYour art is very soft and cute! \n\nPlease consider drawing my FFXIV OC in your style. Her face always looks like she's tired of everyone and everything but she's actually a big softy and only complains to complain but will still help out.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1i1N8t3uWFKAMe-huwA8uPNNqL7mZ36n5/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainlily_00/works/106", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1756a604/uploads/origins/c4125d54-3d9c-41b5-84ea-212fcec4150a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cdc72f5601196427fc20c3085acbf82", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1756a604/uploads/origins/c4125d54-3d9c-41b5-84ea-212fcec4150a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cdc72f5601196427fc20c3085acbf82, https://si.imgix.net/1756a604/uploads/origins/c4125d54-3d9c-41b5-84ea-212fcec4150a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbe0acd80f45c135563a4209094c9716 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1756a604/uploads/origins/c4125d54-3d9c-41b5-84ea-212fcec4150a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84c480fac467b3c3ff510ccfd5d34f80 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art is so beautiful! I would like to request a full body chibi artwork of my character!\nShe live among the clouds. She is gentle and elegant. She has wing ears and golden eyes with a blossom shape. Pose is up to you!\nCan you also provide a transparent png?\n\nAnd if you would like, if you could do a happy and neutral expression? It's okay if not!\nPlease draw freely! I hope you consider my request. Thank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.c