e\nhttps://twitter.com/Eclipse__Group/status/1549692587660808192?s=20&t=Vv4l_MELni8V__7vRsOCJQ\n2 Reference image\nhttps://twitter.com/Eclipse__Group/status/1549694962907770880?s=20&t=Vv4l_MELni8V__7vRsOCJQ\n\nIf there is room in the budget\nIf you can spare the budget, I would be very happy if you could provide me with facial expressions as well!\nIf it's too much, please feel free to decline!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rainlily_00/works/95", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2acb0305/uploads/origins/3ed2bfd7-968d-47c6-a70c-36e057ec07ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=461995b7fee09edce9441ac5bcb938dc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2acb0305/uploads/origins/3ed2bfd7-968d-47c6-a70c-36e057ec07ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=461995b7fee09edce9441ac5bcb938dc, https://si.imgix.net/2acb0305/uploads/origins/3ed2bfd7-968d-47c6-a70c-36e057ec07ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a42697d84b8fc523d37952f72a6b7ea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2acb0305/uploads/origins/3ed2bfd7-968d-47c6-a70c-36e057ec07ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0a1878c2a3fa96c47146c6f653ae869 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art is very cute. I would be happy if you consider my request and draw two original characters in your style:\n\nCharacter A:  150cm. A magician who cannot express emotions well. She is very serious about studying, and spends most of her time alone reading books or working. Awkward around other people, but wants to be closer to them. \n\nCharacter B: 152cm. A goddess who likes chaos. She is in a contractual relationship with Character A, and is always involved in mischief. This character appears from the shadows and has a sharp smile. \n\nThank you very much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UKnGdIq-G_bHO-Z_QaKM0KX